msgstr "Your family's home away from home is waiting for you."

#: core/templates/core/index.html:772
msgid ""
"キチンでグリルの準備や少し料理できる。お風呂の温泉水で一日の疲れを取る。ゆっくりしながらパソコンや携帯でインターネットに繋げる。キッチンでコーヒーや紅茶をいれ、最高の朝を向かう。"
msgstr ""
"Prepare to grill or do a little cooking in the kitchen. Take a spring water "
"bath and wash off the day's work. Relax and connect your computer or phone "
"to the internet. Make coffee or tea in the kitchen and start another "
"sunshiny day."

