"*date* of 2024-5-10, and the due day here is 10, then the due day will "
"result in a due date of 2024-5-20. A value of -1 will result in 'end of the "
"month' value. If the cutoff date is 2024-5-10 and due day here is -1, then "
"the due date will be 2024-5-31."
